OL,3,GNEWSACounty could star in new series of
OL,4,ASlow Horses
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuffolk could take centre stage in the
OL,7,Fnew series of an award-winning spy
OL,8,Fdrama after it was revealed that some
OL,9,Fscenes were shot in the county.
OL,11,FSlow Horses, which stars Gary Oldman
OL,12,Fand Jack Lowden, has returned on Apple
OL,13,FTV for its sixth series, having proved
OL,14,Fincredibly popular with audiences since
OL,15,Ffirst airing in 2022.
OL,17,FScreen Suffolk, which facilitates the
OL,18,Ffilming of productions in the county,
OL,19,Fsaid locations included the Orwell
OL,20,FBridge, Rendlesham and a Babergh
OL,21,Fvillage.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
