OL,3,GNEWSACounty could star in new series of
OL,4,ASlow Horses
OL,5,
OL,6,FRachel Aldridge, operations and
OL,7,Fbusiness development manager for Screen
OL,8,FSuffolk, who is a huge fan of the show,
OL,9,Fsaid she was "so thrilled and so
OL,10,Fexcited" to hopefully see the county on
OL,11,Fscreen.
